<title>GERMANY: German April plant, equipment orders up 17 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>German April plant, equipment orders up 17 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>German plant construction and equipment rose by 17 percent in real terms in April from the same 1996 month, the engineering industry association VDMA said on Friday.</p>
<p>In the three-month period February through April orders were up one percent from the same year-earlier period. The VDMA statement gave the following data:</p>
<p>    April	  change in pct  Jan-April	   change in pct</p>
<p>    overall	    +17	  overall		+1</p>
<p>    of which German  +9	   of which German    +1</p>
<p>		 foreign +24	  foreign		+2</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
